{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261025/photo/bkn-20261025083632515-1025_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261025095400\"/><p>現場遺有香蕉碎。（陳俊華攝）</p><p>觀塘發生高空墮物事件。今晨(25日)7時55分，寶珮苑寶瑛閣對開公園，一名婦人在休息處晨運，正踏健身單車期間，突然有香蕉從天而降，擊中婦人頭部。事主感到頭暈不適，由救護車送院治理。警員封鎖現場調查，相信事件涉及高空墮物。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-25T02:00:38.366545+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T00:36:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-25T02:18:14.751088+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-25T01:58:29.647318+00:00","content_hash":"48cbaf0158c618801969ae0e79b6f51102a8d6d54c4312ae42e5a3e7a0b22ed3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}